{"route":"/mandates/materiovigilance-programme-of-india-mvpi/mvpi-toolkit","kind":"article","crumbs":[{"label":"Products & Services"},{"label":"Materiovigilance Programme of India (MvPI)","href":"/mandates/materiovigilance-programme-of-india-mvpi"},{"label":"MvPI Toolkit"}],"updated":"2026-09-02","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/mandates/materiovigilance-programme-of-india-mvpi/mvpi-toolkit.html","title":"Medical Devices Adverse Event Reporting Tools","bodyHtml":"<p><strong>Indian Pharmacopoeia Commission as National Coordination Centre (NCC) for Materiovigilance Programme of India (MvPI) has developed MvPI tools to promote safety of Medical Devices which was launched on February 8, 2019.</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/mandates/materiovigilance-programme-of-india-mvpi/mvpi-toolkit/8-category-en/1312-medical-device-adverse-event-reporting-form-for-licence-holders-health-care-proffesionals-english-editable-version\" data-internal>Medical Device Adverse Event Reporting form for Licence Holders &amp; Health Care Proffesionals (English Editable version)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/MDAE_Rerporting_Form_Hindi_Version.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Medical Device Adverse Event Reporting form for Licence Holders &amp; Health Care Proffesionals (Hindi Editable version)<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Medical_Device_Adverse_Event_Reporting_form_for_Consumers_or_Users.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Medical Device Adverse Event Reporting form for Consumers/Users <span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/FIELD_SAFETY_CORRECTIVE_ACTION_NOTIFICATION_FSCA_FORM.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">